flowchart TD
    A([Start: los_clear_to_waypoint_guard]) --> B{Are inputs valid?}
    B -->|Yes| C[current_waypoint = waypoints.first]
    B -->|No| D[/Raise ValueError/]
    D --> J

    C --> E[los = LineString current_position, current_waypoint]
    E --> F[unsafe_region = Polygon unsafe_area]
    F --> G{los intersects unsafe_region?}

    G -->|Yes| H[Return True - LOS NOT clear]
    G -->|No| I[Return False - LOS clear]

    H --> J([End])
    I --> J
